<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/represents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a representation to a structure or family of structures it can encode. Multiple representations may encode the same structure."@en <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
