<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresPremise> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a formal result to a hypothesis of the stated result or its claimed guarantee."@en <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
