<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From an algorithm to the problem it solves under its applicability conditions. Does not imply every instance satisfies those conditions."@en <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/graph/asserted> .
